@startuml
' UML State Machine — recording session lifecycle
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
[*] --> NO_SOURCE

NO_SOURCE --> LOCATING_BOARD : source opened
LOCATING_BOARD --> CALIBRATING : board geometry valid
LOCATING_BOARD --> NO_SOURCE : source failed
LOCATING_BOARD --> BOARD_LOST : board not found / timeout
CALIBRATING --> STABLE : orientation and initial state confirmed
CALIBRATING --> UNCERTAIN : orientation / position ambiguous
UNCERTAIN --> CALIBRATING : operator supplies setup
UNCERTAIN --> VERIFYING : new evidence received

STABLE --> MOVING : motion score exceeds threshold
MOVING --> SETTLING : motion stopped
MOVING --> STABLE : transient motion / same position restored
SETTLING --> MOVING : motion resumes
SETTLING --> VERIFYING : settle interval passed [geometry valid]
SETTLING --> UNCERTAIN : timeout / critical occlusion
VERIFYING --> STABLE : candidate accepted and committed
VERIFYING --> UNCERTAIN : no candidate / low margin / low score
VERIFYING --> MOVING : motion resumes
UNCERTAIN --> VERIFYING : additional stable observations
UNCERTAIN --> STABLE : operator confirms / corrects position

STABLE --> BOARD_LOST : geometry invalid / board leaves frame
MOVING --> BOARD_LOST : board lost
SETTLING --> BOARD_LOST : board lost
VERIFYING --> BOARD_LOST : board lost
BOARD_LOST --> LOCATING_BOARD : board visible again

NO_SOURCE --> PAUSED : pause requested
STABLE --> PAUSED : pause requested
UNCERTAIN --> PAUSED : pause requested
PAUSED --> LOCATING_BOARD : resume and recalibrate
PAUSED --> STOPPED : stop requested
STABLE --> STOPPED : stop requested
UNCERTAIN --> STOPPED : stop requested
BOARD_LOST --> STOPPED : stop requested
STOPPED --> [*]
@enduml
